-- INTERFACE ---------------- errors/missing_impl_3.march

`Hue` does not implement interface `Eq`. [missing_impl]
The call to `same` needs it here.

11 |     if same(Rood, Rood) do println("y") else println("n") end
            ^^^^

    Add `derive Eq for Hue` after the type to get the structural one, or write `impl Eq(Hue) do ... end`.

    `same` requires `Eq` here:

9 |   fn same(a, b) when Eq(a) do a == b end
                         ^^^^^


-- CAPABILITY --------------- errors/missing_impl_3.march

`main` performs IO but declares no grant. The program reaches `IO.Console`; a `main` with no capability parameter is granted nothing. [cap_grant]
help: declare the grant `main` actually needs —
        fn main(_cap_console : Cap(IO.Console)) : ()
or grant everything with `fn main(cap : Cap(IO))`.
`forge fix` can apply this.

10 |   fn main() do
       ^^^^^^^^^^^^

    run `march --explain cap_grant`



